[#{{ number }}] Escalated: {{ subject }}
<p>Rule {{ rule }} escalated ticket #{{ number }} of {{ department }}{% if assigned %}, assigned to you{% endif %}: {{ minutes }} minutes went by without a new message.</p>
{% if note %}<div style="margin:16px 0;padding:12px 16px;background:#f4f5f7;border-radius:6px;white-space:pre-wrap;">{{ note }}</div>{% endif %}
{% if portal_url %}<p><a href="{{ portal_url }}/admin/soporte/{{ ticket_id }}">Open the ticket in the admin panel</a></p>{% endif %}
